	(text "ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8: the FujiNet (include/pinmap/fujiversal-intv.h), on 3V3 (the buck).\nEN: 10k / 1 uF power-on delay; RESET (SW2) and the USB bridge's auto-program pair\n(usb sheet) pull it low; BOOT (SW1) and the same pair pull IO0 (100 nF, 10k up).\nIO4 / IO5 drive the RP2354A's RUN and BOOTSEL through Q4 / Q3 (rp-core: high = asserted);\nIO19 / IO20, the S3's own USB, host the RP's.\nmicroSD in SPI mode, the YC158 array's 10k on CS, DO, DI, DAT1 and DAT2; card detect unused.\nSK6805-EC20 status LED on IO48 through 330R, on 3V3.\nThe spare GPIOs (right) are not connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.14 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4ad65dde-9a7d-513a-ac0a-21205c1829d0")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
